          "kind": "fail",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "[ISSUE-102](https://getplumber.io/docs/cli/issues/ISSUE-102): Job `ci/build` uses the forbidden tag `latest` of image `node:latest`.\n\nA new version of `node:latest` runs inside `ci/build` without any change in this repository, holding every secret of the repository and a token that can write to the repository, publish packages and create deployments: a compromise here ships a malicious release to your users or into production. The dependency must be compromised first, so this path is capped at Medium."
